ds-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=The%20guards%20must%20be,about%20their%20internment%E2%80%94or%20else.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e9","summary":"Zita brings a guard's drawing in a coloring book to life, and Kodolaag draws every guard on blight parchment and tears the pages, incapacitating them.","participants":["zita","kodolaag","olrich","blight-parchment"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":214,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":148,"quote":"Electric magic ignites the paper, and the guards wail out in unison as if they're being burned alive.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e10","summary":"Olrich impersonates Dovin Baan to hold off a soldier, and the trio walks out among exiting visitors.","participants":["olrich","kodolaag","zita","dovin-baan"],"location":"udzec","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":214,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":150,"quote":"Citizens! Behold! It is I, your highly esteemed Grand Arbiter, Protector of Justice, Purveyor of Protocols!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e11","summary":"Jitka Wothis and a vampire identify Kodolaag and Olrich, who are bound by magic; Zita escapes into the crowd.","participants":["jitka-wothis","kodolaag","olrich","zita"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":214,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":157,"quote":"Before we can deny it, Olrich and I are bound up in magic.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Before%20we%20can%20deny,bound%20up%20in%20magic.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Before%20we%20can%20deny,bound%20up%20in%20magic.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e15","summary":"Lucinka tells Zita, Olrich and Kodolaag they can never return to their old lives and should form a troupe in the undercity to hunt dangerous escapees.","participants":["lucinka","zita","olrich","kodolaag"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":214,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":178,"quote":"You'll have to set up new lives in the undercity,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=You%27ll%20have%20to%20set,lives%20in%20the%20undercity%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=You%27ll%20have%20to%20set,lives%20in%20the%20undercity%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}}],"relations":[{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-r0","source":"wizards","relation":"romantic","target":"zita","note":"He pursues her, and they end together.","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":214,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","paragraph":81,"quote":"You were amazing.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=You%20were%20amazing.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic